/E (The primary objective of a food delivery system is to ensure timely and efficient delivery of food while maintaining its quality and safety. It aims to provide a seamless customer experience by offering user-friendly platforms for ordering and real-time tracking of deliveries. The system strives to optimize resources and minimize costs, ensuring scalability to handle increased demand without compromising service quality. Sustainability is also a key focus, with efforts to use eco-friendly packaging and reduce environmental impact. Additionally, customer satisfaction is prioritized by integrating feedback to continuously improve services, making the food delivery process reliable, accessible, and efficient.)
/Pg 13 0 R
